window.EUROSCOUT_NOTE_SEED={"sashavezenkov|1995": {"nOff": "• Great spot up shooter, very efficient and consistent\n• Has inside and outside game\n• Very good in attacking closeouts with drives because his shot needs to be respected\n• Good post up technique, likes to go for shots\n• Not scared to play physical, draws many fouls\n• Great spatial awareness, opens passing lanes and often at the right place at the right time\n• Can make some good and sharp passes, makes good decisions in offense", "nDef": "• Very good rebounder, very good feel and positioning\n• Compact post up defender, not easy to move him due to his strong stance\n• Solid feet as hedge defender but not really someone that could switch and defend on perimeter"}};
